INSERT INTO article_i18n (article_id, locale, title, body)
SELECT a.id, 'zh-HK', '私隱政策', '<p><strong>生效日期：</strong>2026 年 11 月 7 日<br>\n<strong>最後更新日期：</strong>2026 年 11 月 7 日</p>\n<p>SisterMart（「姐妹商店」「本店」「我們」）營運網站 <strong>sistermart.vip</strong> 及相關流動網頁（合稱「本服務」），主要向香港用戶提供珠寶及相關商品之網上零售、會員積分、促銷與售後支援。我們重視你的個人資料，並按照香港《個人資料（私隱）條例》（第 486 章，「PDPO」）及相關實務守則處理個人資料。</p>\n<p>請細閱本私隱政策。你註冊帳戶、登入、下單、訂閱通訊或以其他方式使用本服務，即表示你已知悉並同意我們按本政策所述目的收集及使用相關個人資料。若你不同意，請停止使用本服務。</p>\n\n<h2>1. 資料控制者與聯絡方式</h2>\n<p>本服務之個人資料控制者為 SisterMart（姐妹商店）。如對本政策、個人資料查閱／更正／刪除或投訴有任何查詢，請透過：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>電郵：<strong>service@sistermart.vip</strong></li>\n<li>WhatsApp 客服：<strong>+852 5598 3063</strong>（工作時間：每日 10:00–19:00，香港時間）</li>\n<li>本服務「帳戶／聯絡我們」頁面</li>\n</ul>\n<p>我們會在合理時間內回覆；涉及法定查閱／更正要求時，將按 PDPO 時限處理。</p>\n\n<h2>2. 本政策涵蓋範圍</h2>\n<p>本政策適用於透過本服務收集的個人資料，包括但不限於：會員帳戶、訪客瀏覽、訂單與配送、付款核對、積分與簽到、收藏與足跡、優惠券、分銷／推薦、售後與評價、電子通訊訂閱、客服溝通，以及裝置／瀏覽器技術資料。本政策<strong>不</strong>適用於你經本服務連結前往之第三方網站或 App（例如社交平台、支付 App）之獨立私隱實務；該等服務由第三方按其自身政策負責。</p>\n\n<h2>3. 我們收集的個人資料類別</h2>\n<p>視乎你如何使用本服務，我們可能收集下列資料（並非每一項皆必然收集）：</p>\n\n<h3>3.1 帳戶與身份資料</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>電郵地址、手機號碼（含區號，如 +852）</li>\n<li>登入密碼（僅以不可逆加密／雜湊方式儲存，我們無法還原明文）</li>\n<li>暱稱、頭像、介面語言偏好（如 zh-HK／en）</li>\n<li>帳戶狀態、註冊時間、最近活躍時間</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>3.2 驗證與安全資料</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>一次性驗證碼（OTP）發送與核對記錄（電郵及／或 WhatsApp 通道）</li>\n<li>登入／註冊嘗試時間、結果，以及為防欺詐所需之基本裝置或連線資訊</li>\n<li>會話權杖（session token）及相關有效期</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>3.3 訂單、配送與付款相關資料</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>收件人姓名、電話、配送地址（包括地區／街道等你填寫之欄位）</li>\n<li>訂單編號、商品／SKU、數量、金額、運費、優惠與積分抵扣</li>\n<li>訂單狀態、出貨／物流狀態、售後申請與處理紀錄</li>\n<li>付款方式選擇、付款狀態、第三方支付／回調之交易參考號（我們<strong>不會</strong>儲存完整銀行卡號或支付 App 密碼）</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>3.4 會員營運與互動資料</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>積分餘額、積分流水、積分商城兌換紀錄</li>\n<li>每日簽到與連續簽到獎勵紀錄</li>\n<li>商品收藏、瀏覽足跡</li>\n<li>優惠券領取／使用紀錄</li>\n<li>分銷／推薦關係（如推薦碼、下線訂單佣金結算相關資料，僅在你參與分銷計劃時適用）</li>\n<li>商品評價內容、評分及你上傳之評價圖片</li>\n<li>售後申請理由、說明文字及你提交之證據圖片</li>\n<li>站內訊息／訂單聊天內容</li>\n<li>電子通訊（newsletter）訂閱狀態與電郵</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>3.5 客服與通訊資料</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>你透過 WhatsApp、電郵或站內渠道向我們提供的訊息、附件與聯絡偏好</li>\n<li>為處理查詢而產生的工單／備註（僅限營運所需）</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>3.6 技術、裝置與本機儲存資料</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>瀏覽器類型、作業系統、螢幕／裝置大致資訊、語言、時區</li>\n<li>IP 位址、請求時間、錯誤日誌（用於安全、除錯與防濫用）</li>\n<li>Cookies、localStorage／sessionStorage 等本機儲存（見第 8 節），例如登入狀態、購物車、語言、臨時站點通行標記、介面提示狀態等</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>3.7 你自願提供的其他資料</h3>\n<p>例如你在表單、活動或客服對話中主動提供的補充說明。請勿提交與服務無關之敏感資料（如完整身份證明文件號碼），除非我們因法律或特定流程明確要求並另行說明用途。</p>\n\n<h2>4. 收集方式</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>你直接提供：</strong>註冊／登入、填寫地址、下單、評價、售後、訂閱、客服對話等</li>\n<li><strong>自動收集：</strong>你使用本服務時，系統記錄技術日誌、本機儲存及必要的操作紀錄</li>\n<li><strong>第三方通道回傳：</strong>例如電郵發送服務商之投遞狀態、WhatsApp 訊息狀態、支付網關付款結果回調、物流狀態更新（僅限完成服務所需）</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>5. 收集及使用目的</h2>\n<p>我們按 PDPO 之目的說明與使用限制原則，僅為下列目的使用個人資料：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>帳戶管理：</strong>建立、驗證、維護與保護你的會員帳戶；處理登入、登出、密碼重設與 OTP 驗證</li>\n<li><strong>交易履行：</strong>處理購物車、下單、庫存核對、付款確認、開票／對帳所需紀錄、配送與簽收跟進</li>\n<li><strong>客戶服務與售後：</strong>回覆查詢、處理退換／售後、評價審核與糾紛協調</li>\n<li><strong>會員權益與營運：</strong>積分發放與兌換、簽到獎勵、優惠券、收藏／足跡、分銷佣金結算（如適用）</li>\n<li><strong>必要通知：</strong>發送與帳戶安全、訂單狀態、付款結果、出貨、售後進度相關之交易性／服務性通訊（此類通訊一般不依賴市場推廣同意）</li>\n<li><strong>經你同意之推廣：</strong>在你訂閱電子通訊或另有明示同意的情況下，發送優惠、新品或活動資訊；你可隨時退訂</li>\n<li><strong>安全與合規：</strong>防止欺詐、濫用、未經授權存取；偵測異常登入；遵守適用法律、監管或執法要求；維護本服務穩定</li>\n<li><strong>產品改善：</strong>在合理及盡量去識別／匯總的前提下，分析使用情況以改善網站體驗、內容與流程（不會為此向無關第三方出售個人資料）</li>\n</ol>\n<p>若我們擬將資料用於與原收集目的<strong>直接有關以外</strong>之新目的，會按 PDPO 要求先取得你的訂明同意，或依法律允許之其他依據處理。</p>\n\n<h2>6. 直接促銷（Direct Marketing）</h2>\n<p>若我們擬使用你的姓名、電郵、電話等資料作直接促銷（例如優惠、活動訊息），會按 PDPO 第 35 條等規定：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>告知擬使用之資料類別、促銷標的類別，並取得你的同意（訂明同意）後才發送；及／或</li>\n<li>提供簡易的拒絕／退訂方式（例如通訊內退訂連結、帳戶設定或聯絡客服）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>交易性通知</strong>（訂單、付款、物流、安全驗證等）不屬於上述直接促銷範圍，即使你退訂推廣通訊，我們仍可能發送該等必要訊息。</p>\n\n<h2>7. 資料披露與處理者</h2>\n<p>我們<strong>不會出售</strong>你的個人資料。僅在完成第 5 節目的所必需時，向以下類別之受信方披露<strong>最少必要</strong>資料，並要求其僅按指示處理及採取適當保安措施：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>基礎設施與託管：</strong>伺服器／資料庫託管、內容傳遞與備份服務供應商</li>\n<li><strong>電郵發送：</strong>交易郵件與 OTP 電郵之發送服務商（如 Resend 或其繼任供應商）</li>\n<li><strong>即時通訊：</strong>WhatsApp／Meta 相關通道（用於 OTP 或客服訊息，視我們啟用之功能而定）</li>\n<li><strong>支付服務：</strong>香港地區支付／收單機構或聚合支付服務商（處理付款狀態與對帳參考號）</li>\n<li><strong>物流與配送：</strong>承運商／速遞（收件人姓名、電話、地址及包裹所需資訊）</li>\n<li><strong>專業顧問：</strong>在保密義務下之法律、審計或合規顧問（僅在有需要時）</li>\n<li><strong>執法／監管：</strong>在法律要求、法院命令或為保護權利、安全與防欺詐所必需時</li>\n</ul>\n<p>上述處理者可能位於香港以外地區；見第 9 節。</p>\n\n<h2>8. Cookies 與本機儲存</h2>\n<p>本服務使用 Cookies 及瀏覽器本機儲存，以便：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>維持登入狀態與會話安全</li>\n<li>記住語言、購物車、介面偏好</li>\n<li>臨時站點通行／防濫用或營運所需之提示狀態</li>\n<li>量度基本訪問與錯誤以便維運（如有）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>你可在瀏覽器設定中清除或限制 Cookies／本機儲存；惟部分功能（如保持登入、購物車）可能無法正常運作。我們不會透過本服務部署與核心購物無關之第三方廣告追蹤網絡作為預設做法；若日後引入非必要追蹤，會另行說明並在適用時提供選擇。</p>\n\n<h2>9. 跨境傳輸</h2>\n<p>本服務主要服務香港用戶。為營運需要，個人資料可能傳輸至或儲存於香港以外之伺服器或由境外處理者處理（例如雲端託管、電郵／訊息發送）。我們會採取合理步驟，確保接收方對資料提供與 PDPO 要求相若之保障，並僅傳輸完成服務所需之資料。</p>\n\n<h2>10. 保存期限</h2>\n<p>我們只在達致收集目的所需期間保存個人資料，其後會刪除、銷毀或以合理方式匿名化。一般參考如下（如法律要求或爭議未決，可能延長）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>帳戶資料：</strong>帳戶存續期間，以及帳戶關閉或刪除後為處理剩餘義務／防欺詐所需之合理期間</li>\n<li><strong>訂單、付款與發票相關紀錄：</strong>通常保存至符合商業、會計及稅務留存要求之期間（常見為交易後至少 7 年，實際以適用法例及內部政策為準）</li>\n<li><strong>OTP 與安全日誌：</strong>較短期間，以完成驗證、防濫用與安全稽核為限</li>\n<li><strong>客服與售後紀錄：</strong>至爭議／售後窗口結束後之合理期間</li>\n<li><strong>推廣訂閱名單：</strong>至你退訂或我們終止該通訊計劃為止</li>\n<li><strong>評價與用戶生成內容：</strong>在內容展示及營運所需期間；經你請求刪除且無須依法保留時，我們會合理處理</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>11. 保安措施</h2>\n<p>我們採取合理的技術與組織措施保護個人資料，包括但不限於：傳輸層加密（HTTPS）、密碼雜湊儲存、存取權限控管、管理後台認證、輸入驗證，以及定期備份與異常監控。請注意，互聯網傳輸無法保證絕對安全；請妥善保管你的密碼與裝置，勿向他人透露 OTP。如發現帳戶異常，請立即聯絡我們並重設密碼。</p>\n\n<h2>12. 你的權利</h2>\n<p>在 PDPO 下，你就個人資料一般享有以下權利（在適用例外及法定條件下）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>查閱：</strong>要求知悉我們是否持有你的個人資料及取得副本</li>\n<li><strong>更正：</strong>要求更正不準確的個人資料</li>\n<li><strong>帳戶內自助更新：</strong>在「帳戶」相關頁面更新部分資料（如暱稱、頭像、地址簿等，以實際功能為準）</li>\n<li><strong>退訂推廣：</strong>拒絕或撤回直接促銷同意</li>\n<li><strong>刪除／停用請求：</strong>在法律允許範圍內請求刪除或停用帳戶；我們可能因未完成訂單、爭議、會計／法律留存義務而需保留部分資料</li>\n</ul>\n<p>行使查閱／更正權時，請電郵 <strong>service@sistermart.vip</strong>，並提供足夠資訊以核實身份。我們可能按法例允許收取合理費用處理查閱要求。如你對我們的回覆不滿意，可向香港個人資料私隱專員公署（PCPD）投訴：<a href="https://www.pcpd.org.hk/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://www.pcpd.org.hk/</a></p>\n\n<h2>13. 兒童與未成年人</h2>\n<p>本服務主要面向具有完全行為能力之成年消費者。我們不會故意收集 16 歲以下兒童的個人資料。若你認為我們誤收了兒童資料，請聯絡我們，我們會盡快刪除或採取其他適當措施。</p>\n\n<h2>14. 自動化決策</h2>\n<p>本服務可能使用規則化邏輯處理訂單風控、庫存、優惠資格或積分計算等。該等處理旨在履行合約與防欺詐，並非以對你產生重大法律影響之全面自動化剖析為目的。如你對特定決定有疑問，可聯絡客服人工覆核。</p>\n\n<h2>15. 第三方連結與社交登入／分享</h2>\n<p>本服務可能包含通往 Facebook、WhatsApp 或其他網站之連結或分享功能。你與該等第三方互動時，其資料處理受其私隱政策約束。請在向第三方授權前細閱其條款。</p>\n\n<h2>16. 政策更新</h2>\n<p>我們可不時更新本私隱政策，以反映服務、法律或營運變更。更新後會在本頁公布新版本及更新日期；重大變更時，我們可能透過網站公告、登入提示或電郵（如適用）另行通知。請定期查閱本頁。更新生效後繼續使用本服務，即表示你知悉更新後的政策。</p>\n\n<h2>17. 管轄與語言</h2>\n<p>本政策受中華人民共和國香港特別行政區法律解釋及管轄。本政策提供中文（繁體）與英文版本；如有歧義，<strong>以中文（繁體）版本為準</strong>。</p>\n\n<h2>18. 與其他條款之關係</h2>\n<p>本私隱政策與《用戶協議》及其他店舖政策（如運送、退貨）一併適用。若涉及個人資料處理之說明與其他文件不一致，就個人資料事宜以本政策為準。</p>\n'
FROM articles a WHERE a.code='privacy'
ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE title=VALUES(title), body=VALUES(body);

INSERT INTO article_i18n (article_id, locale, title, body)
SELECT a.id, 'en', 'Privacy Policy', '<p><strong>Effective date:</strong> 7 November 2026<br>\n<strong>Last updated:</strong> 7 November 2026</p>\n<p>SisterMart (“we”, “us”, “our”) operates <strong>sistermart.vip</strong> and related mobile web pages (together, the “Service”), primarily offering online retail of jewellery and related goods, membership points, promotions and after-sales support to users in Hong Kong. We respect your privacy and handle personal data in accordance with the Personal Data (Privacy) Ordinance (Cap. 486) (“PDPO”) and applicable codes of practice.</p>\n<p>Please read this Privacy Policy carefully. By registering, signing in, placing orders, subscribing to communications or otherwise using the Service, you acknowledge that we may collect and use personal data for the purposes described here. If you do not agree, please stop using the Service.</p>\n\n<h2>1. Data controller and contact</h2>\n<p>The data controller for the Service is SisterMart. For questions about this Policy, data access/correction/erasure requests or complaints, contact us via:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Email: <strong>service@sistermart.vip</strong></li>\n<li>WhatsApp customer service: <strong>+852 5598 3063</strong> (daily 10:00–19:00, Hong Kong time)</li>\n<li>The in-Service Account / Contact Us pages</li>\n</ul>\n<p>We will respond within a reasonable time and, for statutory access/correction requests, within the timeframes required under the PDPO.</p>\n\n<h2>2. Scope</h2>\n<p>This Policy covers personal data collected through the Service, including membership accounts, browsing, orders and delivery, payment confirmation, points and check-ins, favourites and browsing history, coupons, distribution/referral, after-sales and reviews, newsletter subscriptions, customer support, and device/browser technical data. It does <strong>not</strong> cover third-party websites or apps linked from the Service (e.g. social platforms or payment apps), which are governed by their own policies.</p>\n\n<h2>3. Categories of personal data we collect</h2>\n<p>Depending on how you use the Service, we may collect the following (not all items are always collected):</p>\n\n<h3>3.1 Account and identity data</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Email address and mobile number (including country/area code, e.g. +852)</li>\n<li>Login password (stored only in irreversible hashed form; we cannot recover the plaintext)</li>\n<li>Nickname, avatar and UI language preference (e.g. zh-HK / en)</li>\n<li>Account status, registration time and last active time</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>3.2 Verification and security data</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>One-time password (OTP) send and verification logs (email and/or WhatsApp channels)</li>\n<li>Sign-in/registration attempt times and outcomes, and basic device or connection data needed for fraud prevention</li>\n<li>Session tokens and related expiry information</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>3.3 Order, delivery and payment-related data</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Recipient name, phone number and delivery address fields you provide</li>\n<li>Order ID, products/SKUs, quantities, amounts, shipping fees, discounts and points redemption</li>\n<li>Order status, shipment/logistics status, after-sales requests and handling records</li>\n<li>Chosen payment method, payment status and third-party payment/callback reference IDs (we do <strong>not</strong> store full card numbers or payment-app passwords)</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>3.4 Membership operations and engagement data</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Points balance, points ledger and points-mall redemption records</li>\n<li>Daily check-in and streak reward records</li>\n<li>Product favourites and browsing footprints</li>\n<li>Coupon claim/use records</li>\n<li>Distribution/referral relationships (e.g. referral codes and commission settlement data), only if you join a distribution programme</li>\n<li>Review text, ratings and review images you upload</li>\n<li>After-sales reasons, descriptions and evidence images you submit</li>\n<li>In-app messages / order chat content</li>\n<li>Newsletter subscription status and email</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>3.5 Customer support and communications</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Messages, attachments and contact preferences you provide via WhatsApp, email or in-app channels</li>\n<li>Operational notes/tickets created to handle your enquiry</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>3.6 Technical, device and local storage data</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Browser type, OS, approximate device/screen info, language and time zone</li>\n<li>IP address, request timestamps and error logs (for security, debugging and abuse prevention)</li>\n<li>Cookies and localStorage/sessionStorage (see Section 8), such as sign-in state, cart, language, temporary site-access flags and UI tip states</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>3.7 Other data you voluntarily provide</h3>\n<p>For example information you submit in forms, campaigns or support chats. Please do not send sensitive data unrelated to the Service (e.g. full identity document numbers) unless we expressly request it for a stated purpose.</p>\n\n<h2>4. How we collect data</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Directly from you:</strong> registration/sign-in, addresses, checkout, reviews, after-sales, subscriptions, support chats, etc.</li>\n<li><strong>Automatically:</strong> technical logs, local storage and necessary operation records when you use the Service</li>\n<li><strong>From service channels:</strong> e.g. email delivery status from our mail provider, WhatsApp message status, payment gateway callbacks, logistics updates — only as needed to fulfil the Service</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>5. Purposes of collection and use</h2>\n<p>In line with PDPO purpose and use-limitation principles, we use personal data only for:</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Account management:</strong> creating, verifying, maintaining and securing your membership; sign-in/out, password reset and OTP verification</li>\n<li><strong>Order fulfilment:</strong> cart, checkout, stock checks, payment confirmation, records needed for reconciliation, delivery and receipt follow-up</li>\n<li><strong>Customer service and after-sales:</strong> answering queries, returns/after-sales handling, review moderation and dispute coordination</li>\n<li><strong>Membership benefits and operations:</strong> points issuance/redemption, check-in rewards, coupons, favourites/footprints, distribution commission settlement (where applicable)</li>\n<li><strong>Necessary notices:</strong> transactional/service messages about account security, order status, payment results, shipment and after-sales progress (generally not dependent on marketing consent)</li>\n<li><strong>Marketing with consent:</strong> offers, new arrivals or campaigns where you subscribed to a newsletter or otherwise gave express consent; you may unsubscribe at any time</li>\n<li><strong>Security and compliance:</strong> preventing fraud, abuse and unauthorised access; detecting anomalous sign-ins; complying with law, regulators or law enforcement; keeping the Service stable</li>\n<li><strong>Service improvement:</strong> analysing usage in aggregated or de-identified form where practicable to improve experience and flows (we do not sell personal data for this)</li>\n</ol>\n<p>If we intend to use data for a new purpose not directly related to the original purpose, we will obtain your prescribed consent as required by the PDPO, or rely on another lawful basis permitted by law.</p>\n\n<h2>6. Direct marketing</h2>\n<p>If we intend to use your name, email, phone number or similar data for direct marketing (e.g. promotions), we will, under PDPO s.35 and related rules:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Inform you of the classes of data and marketing subjects, and obtain your consent (prescribed consent) before sending; and/or</li>\n<li>Provide an easy opt-out (unsubscribe link, account settings or customer service)</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Transactional notices</strong> (orders, payments, logistics, security verification, etc.) are not direct marketing. Even if you opt out of promotions, we may still send those necessary messages.</p>\n\n<h2>7. Disclosure and processors</h2>\n<p>We do <strong>not sell</strong> your personal data. We disclose only the <strong>minimum necessary</strong> data to trusted parties below, solely to achieve Section 5 purposes, and require them to process data on our instructions with appropriate safeguards:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Infrastructure &amp; hosting:</strong> server/database hosting, CDN and backup providers</li>\n<li><strong>Email delivery:</strong> providers that send transactional and OTP emails (e.g. Resend or a successor)</li>\n<li><strong>Messaging:</strong> WhatsApp/Meta-related channels (for OTP or support messages, depending on enabled features)</li>\n<li><strong>Payments:</strong> Hong Kong payment/acquiring or aggregator providers (payment status and reconciliation references)</li>\n<li><strong>Logistics:</strong> carriers/couriers (recipient name, phone, address and parcel information)</li>\n<li><strong>Professional advisors:</strong> legal, audit or compliance advisors under confidentiality, when needed</li>\n<li><strong>Law enforcement/regulators:</strong> where required by law, court order, or necessary to protect rights, safety and prevent fraud</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Processors may be located outside Hong Kong; see Section 9.</p>\n\n<h2>8. Cookies and local storage</h2>\n<p>We use cookies and browser local storage to:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Maintain sign-in state and session security</li>\n<li>Remember language, cart and UI preferences</li>\n<li>Support temporary site-access / anti-abuse or operational tip states</li>\n<li>Measure basic visits and errors for operations (if applicable)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>You can clear or restrict cookies/local storage in your browser; some features (persistent sign-in, cart) may then stop working. We do not by default deploy third-party advertising tracking networks unrelated to core shopping; if we introduce non-essential tracking later, we will explain and offer choices where applicable.</p>\n\n<h2>9. Cross-border transfers</h2>\n<p>The Service mainly serves Hong Kong users. For operations, personal data may be transferred to or stored on servers outside Hong Kong, or processed by overseas processors (e.g. cloud hosting, email/messaging). We take reasonable steps so that recipients provide protection comparable to PDPO requirements, and transfer only what is needed to provide the Service.</p>\n\n<h2>10. Retention</h2>\n<p>We keep personal data only as long as needed for the purposes collected, then delete, destroy or anonymise it in a reasonable manner. Typical periods (which may be extended for legal holds or unresolved disputes):</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Account data:</strong> while the account remains active, plus a reasonable period after closure/deletion for residual obligations and fraud prevention</li>\n<li><strong>Order, payment and invoice-related records:</strong> generally for commercial, accounting and tax retention needs (commonly at least 7 years after the transaction; actual period follows applicable law and internal policy)</li>\n<li><strong>OTP and security logs:</strong> a shorter period limited to verification, abuse prevention and security audit</li>\n<li><strong>Support and after-sales records:</strong> a reasonable period after the dispute/after-sales window ends</li>\n<li><strong>Marketing subscription lists:</strong> until you unsubscribe or we end the programme</li>\n<li><strong>Reviews and user-generated content:</strong> while needed for display and operations; we will handle deletion requests reasonably where law does not require retention</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>11. Security</h2>\n<p>We apply reasonable technical and organisational measures, including HTTPS, password hashing, access controls, admin authentication, input validation, backups and anomaly monitoring. Internet transmission is not perfectly secure; please protect your password and device and never share OTPs. Contact us immediately and reset your password if you suspect account misuse.</p>\n\n<h2>12. Your rights</h2>\n<p>Under the PDPO you generally have rights (subject to exceptions and conditions) to:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Access:</strong> ask whether we hold your personal data and obtain a copy</li>\n<li><strong>Correction:</strong> request correction of inaccurate personal data</li>\n<li><strong>Self-service updates:</strong> update certain fields in Account pages (nickname, avatar, address book, etc., as available)</li>\n<li><strong>Opt out of marketing:</strong> refuse or withdraw consent to direct marketing</li>\n<li><strong>Deletion/deactivation requests:</strong> request account deletion or deactivation where permitted; we may retain some data for open orders, disputes, or accounting/legal retention</li>\n</ul>\n<p>To exercise access/correction rights, email <strong>service@sistermart.vip</strong> with enough information to verify your identity. We may charge a fee permitted by law for access requests. If you are not satisfied with our response, you may complain to the Office of the Privacy Commissioner for Personal Data, Hong Kong (PCPD): <a href="https://www.pcpd.org.hk/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://www.pcpd.org.hk/</a></p>\n\n<h2>13. Children</h2>\n<p>The Service is intended for adults with full legal capacity. We do not knowingly collect personal data from children under 16. If you believe we have collected a child’s data in error, contact us and we will delete it or take other appropriate steps promptly.</p>\n\n<h2>14. Automated decision-making</h2>\n<p>We may use rule-based logic for order risk checks, stock, promotion eligibility or points calculation. This supports contract performance and fraud prevention and is not intended as fully automated profiling with significant legal effects. Contact customer service if you want a human review of a specific decision.</p>\n\n<h2>15. Third-party links and social features</h2>\n<p>The Service may link to or share via Facebook, WhatsApp or other sites. Your interactions with those parties are governed by their privacy policies. Review their terms before granting permissions.</p>\n\n<h2>16. Policy updates</h2>\n<p>We may update this Privacy Policy to reflect service, legal or operational changes. The new version and update date will be posted on this page; for material changes we may also notify you via site notice, sign-in prompt or email where appropriate. Please check this page periodically. Continued use after an update means you acknowledge the revised Policy.</p>\n\n<h2>17. Governing law and language</h2>\n<p>This Policy is governed by the laws of the Hong Kong Special Administrative Region of the People’s Republic of China. It is provided in Traditional Chinese and English. In case of inconsistency, the <strong>Traditional Chinese version prevails</strong>.</p>\n\n<h2>18. Relationship with other terms</h2>\n<p>This Privacy Policy applies together with the User Agreement and other shop policies (e.g. shipping, returns). If statements about personal data conflict, this Policy prevails on privacy matters.</p>\n'
FROM articles a WHERE a.code='privacy'
ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE title=VALUES(title), body=VALUES(body);

-- SisterMart 退款政策 — upsert article_i18n for code=refund
INSERT INTO articles (code, status, show_in_footer, sort_order, created_at, updated_at)
SELECT 'refund', 1, 1, 60, NOW(), NOW() FROM DUAL
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM articles WHERE code='refund');
UPDATE articles SET status=1, show_in_footer=1, sort_order=60, updated_at=NOW() WHERE code='refund';

INSERT INTO article_i18n (article_id, locale, title, body)
SELECT a.id, 'zh-HK', '退款政策', '<p><strong>生效日期：</strong>2026 年 11 月 7 日<br>\n<strong>最後更新日期：</strong>2026 年 11 月 7 日</p>\n<p>本《退款政策》說明 SisterMart（姐妹商店）何時及如何退款，並與《退貨政策》《運送政策》《用戶協議》一併適用。退款並非自動權利：須符合本政策及《退貨政策》，並經我們審核／驗貨確認。為保障店家合法權益與防範濫用，我們保留核實交易、調整退款構成、分期或延後處理，以及在合理情況下拒絕或僅部分退款之操作空間（法律強制規定除外）。</p>\n\n<h2>1. 可退款情形</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>按《退貨政策》完成退貨，且收貨檢驗<strong>合格</strong>後</li>\n<li>付款成功後，因我們原因長期未能出貨，且你選擇取消，經我們確認可取消之訂單</li>\n<li>經核實之重複扣款、系統計價錯誤、明顯多收運費或其他我方責任之金額錯誤</li>\n<li>錯發／漏發且雙方同意以退款代替補發或換貨</li>\n<li>其他我們書面同意退款之情形</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>2. 不退款或僅部分退款之情形</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>不符合《退貨政策》或驗貨不合格</li>\n<li>已使用之優惠權益、不可撤回之第三方費用、或商品貶值／缺件部分</li>\n<li>因顧客提供錯誤地址、拒收、不取件導致之額外物流成本（可自退款中扣除）</li>\n<li>贈品、包裝耗材、發票手續等已發生且無法退回之成本（按個案說明）</li>\n<li>涉嫌欺詐、調包、惡意拒付或濫用售後</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>3. 退款構成與計算</h2>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>商品款：</strong>原則按該件實付金額計算（已扣除該件分攤之優惠後）。</li>\n<li><strong>訂單優惠／滿減／券：</strong>退款後若剩餘商品不再滿足活動門檻，我們有權追回相應優惠差額（自退款中扣減或要求補差）。</li>\n<li><strong>積分：</strong>下單抵扣之積分，可按規則返還；因本筆訂單已發放之積分，我們有權扣回。積分商城兌換訂單之退款規則可另行限制。</li>\n<li><strong>運費：</strong>\n  <ul>\n    <li>質量問題／錯發：原訂單運費與經同意之寄回運費，可按合理範圍退還或報銷</li>\n    <li>非質量問題：原訂單運費通常不退；寄回與補發運費由顧客承擔</li>\n    <li>部分退貨後剩餘商品未達免運門檻：可自退款中補收應付運費</li>\n  </ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>手續／檢測／補貨費：</strong>對個人原因退貨或狀態瑕疵但仍協商處理之個案，我們可扣除合理費用後再退餘額。</li>\n</ol>\n\n<h2>4. 退款方式</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>原則退回<strong>原支付途徑</strong>（信用卡／支付平台／其他當次付款渠道）。</li>\n<li>若原途徑無法退回或已失效，我們可在通知你後改以其他合理方式處理（例如商店餘額、優惠券折讓或雙方同意之轉帳安排）。</li>\n<li>我們<strong>不保證</strong>以現金或非原途徑即時退款；具體以可執行之支付渠道規則為準。</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>5. 處理與到帳時間</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>起算點：</strong>以我們完成驗貨（如適用）並在系統確認「同意退款」之日起算，而非你提交申請或寄出商品之日。</li>\n<li><strong>我方處理：</strong>確認後一般於 <strong>3–15 個工作天</strong>內提交退款指令（遇對帳、風控、節假日或支付機構審核可能延長）。</li>\n<li><strong>到帳：</strong>支付機構／銀行入帳通常另需數個工作天，實際以對方為準；我們無法控制第三方到帳速度。</li>\n<li>同一訂單多次售後、爭議未決或需補證時，我們可暫停退款直至事項澄清。</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>6. 取消訂單與出貨後</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>未出貨：</strong>可申請取消；是否成功視倉庫作業進度。已開始揀貨／交運者，可能無法取消，改按退貨流程。</li>\n<li><strong>已出貨：</strong>不支持僅以「不想要」為由直接線上全額退款；須按《退貨政策》退回並驗貨。</li>\n<li>你已申請支付機構爭議／拒付時，我們可中止雙軌處理，優先以爭議結果及證據為準，並保留提供物流與溝通紀錄之權利。</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>7. 部分退款與換貨差價</h2>\n<p>多件訂單可只退符合條件之部分。換貨涉及差價時，多退少補；少補未完成前，我們可暫不發出替換商品。部分退款之運費與優惠重算依第 3 節。</p>\n\n<h2>8. 發票與記錄</h2>\n<p>退款完成後，交易記錄、積分與優惠狀態以系統為準。如需調整發票／收據記載，請在退款完成後聯絡客服，我們於合理範圍協助。</p>\n\n<h2>9. 酌情權與防濫用</h2>\n<p>在適用法律允許範圍內，SisterMart 可就爭議個案作出合理商業判斷（包括部分退款、延期、折讓替代現金、或拒絕）。對異常高頻退貨、拒付或虛假陳述，我們可限制購買／售後權限，並保留追討已退款項及相關損失之權利。</p>\n\n<h2>10. 聯絡與更新</h2>\n<p>電郵 <strong>service@sistermart.vip</strong>；WhatsApp <strong>+852 5598 3063</strong>（10:00–19:00，香港時間）。政策更新以本頁為準；已確認退款之案件不因政策更新而重新計算，另有約定或法律規定除外。</p>\n'
FROM articles a WHERE a.code='refund'
ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE title=VALUES(title), body=VALUES(body);

INSERT INTO article_i18n (article_id, locale, title, body)
SELECT a.id, 'en', 'Refund Policy', '<p><strong>Effective date:</strong> 7 November 2026<br>\n<strong>Last updated:</strong> 7 November 2026</p>\n<p>This Refund Policy explains when and how SisterMart issues refunds, together with the Return Policy, Shipping Policy and User Agreement. A refund is not automatic: it must meet this Policy and the Return Policy and pass our review/inspection. To protect lawful merchant interests and prevent abuse, we may verify the transaction, adjust the refund breakdown, pause or stage processing, and refuse or partially refund where reasonable (except where mandatory law requires otherwise).</p>\n\n<h2>1. When we may refund</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>After a return under the Return Policy and a <strong>passed</strong> inbound inspection</li>\n<li>After successful payment, where we fail to ship for a prolonged period due to our reasons and you choose to cancel a cancellable order we confirm</li>\n<li>Verified duplicate charges, pricing system errors, clearly overcharged shipping, or other amount errors attributable to us</li>\n<li>Wrong/missing items where both sides agree to refund instead of reship/exchange</li>\n<li>Other cases we agree to refund in writing</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>2. No refund or partial refund only</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Requests that fail the Return Policy or inspection</li>\n<li>Used promotional benefits, non-reversible third-party fees, or depreciation/missing-parts portions</li>\n<li>Extra logistics costs from wrong address, refusal or unclaimed parcels (may be deducted)</li>\n<li>Gifts, packing consumables or costs already incurred and non-returnable (case by case)</li>\n<li>Suspected fraud, item swapping, chargeback abuse or after-sales abuse</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>3. Refund composition</h2>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Item price:</strong> generally the amount actually paid for that item (after allocating discounts).</li>\n<li><strong>Order promos / thresholds / coupons:</strong> if remaining items no longer meet a campaign threshold after refund, we may claw back the related discount (deduct from refund or require a top-up).</li>\n<li><strong>Points:</strong> points used at checkout may be restored by rule; points earned from the order may be clawed back. Points-mall orders may have stricter refund limits.</li>\n<li><strong>Shipping:</strong>\n  <ul>\n    <li>Quality issues / wrong items: original outbound shipping and approved return shipping may be refunded or reimbursed within reason</li>\n    <li>Non-quality returns: original outbound shipping is usually non-refundable; return/reship shipping is yours</li>\n    <li>Partial returns that break free-shipping eligibility: we may deduct the shipping then due</li>\n  </ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>Handling / inspection / restocking:</strong> for change-of-mind or imperfect-condition cases still handled by agreement, we may deduct reasonable fees before refunding the balance.</li>\n</ol>\n\n<h2>4. Refund method</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Refunds generally go to the <strong>original payment method</strong>.</li>\n<li>If that channel cannot receive funds or has expired, we may notify you and use another reasonable method (store credit, coupon goodwill, or an agreed transfer).</li>\n<li>We do <strong>not guarantee</strong> cash or instant non-original-path refunds; provider rules apply.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>5. Timing</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Start date:</strong> from the day we complete inspection (if any) and confirm “refund approved” in our system—not from your request or ship-back date.</li>\n<li><strong>Our processing:</strong> after confirmation we usually submit the refund instruction within <strong>3–15 business days</strong> (reconciliation, risk checks, holidays or provider review may extend this).</li>\n<li><strong>Arrival:</strong> banks/payment providers often need additional business days; we cannot control their speed.</li>\n<li>Multiple after-sales on one order, open disputes or missing evidence may pause the refund until clarified.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>6. Cancellation vs shipped orders</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Not yet shipped:</strong> you may request cancellation; success depends on warehouse progress. Once picking/handover started, cancellation may fail and the Return Policy applies.</li>\n<li><strong>Already shipped:</strong> “changed my mind” alone does not entitle an instant full online refund; goods must return and pass inspection under the Return Policy.</li>\n<li>If you open a payment dispute/chargeback, we may pause parallel handling and rely on the dispute record, while retaining the right to submit logistics and communication evidence.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>7. Partial refunds and exchange balances</h2>\n<p>Multi-item orders may be refunded only for eligible lines. Exchange price differences are settled (refund or top-up); we may hold the replacement until any top-up is paid. Shipping and promo recalculation follow Section 3.</p>\n\n<h2>8. Records</h2>\n<p>After refund, orders, points and benefits follow system records. For invoice/receipt adjustments, contact support after the refund completes; we will help within reason.</p>\n\n<h2>9. Discretion and anti-abuse</h2>\n<p>Where law allows, SisterMart may make a reasonable commercial decision on disputed cases (partial refund, delay, goodwill instead of cash, or refusal). For abnormal return frequency, chargebacks or false statements, we may limit purchase/after-sales access and recover refunded sums and related losses.</p>\n\n<h2>10. Contact and updates</h2>\n<p>Email <strong>service@sistermart.vip</strong>; WhatsApp <strong>+852 5598 3063</strong> (10:00–19:00, Hong Kong time). Updates appear on this page. Confirmed refunds are not recalculated solely because the Policy later changes, unless agreed or required by law.</p>\n'
FROM articles a WHERE a.code='refund'
ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE title=VALUES(title), body=VALUES(body);

INSERT INTO articles (code, status, show_in_footer, sort_order, created_at, updated_at)
